{"text": "After the party, Ichabod stayed behind to talk with Katrina, hoping that she would say yes to him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nobody knows what she said, but he soon came out looking very sad and went straight to the stable. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was the hour when ghosts are said to walk, and all the stories came back to his mind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Riding past a huge old tree, he heard a groan, but it was only the branches rubbing together. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Near a dark stream, Gunpowder suddenly stopped, and Ichabod saw a huge black shape standing among the trees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who are you, he called in a shaking voice, but the rider did not answer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The stranger, riding a powerful black horse, silently kept pace with Ichabod on the dark road. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then, against the night sky, Ichabod saw with horror that the rider had no head on his shoulders. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His fear grew when he saw the head itself sitting on the front of the riders saddle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ichabod kicked Gunpowder, and the two horses raced through the dark, stones flying under their hooves.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "a", "r", "t", "y", ",", " ", "I", "c", "h", "a", "b", "o", "d", " ", "s", "t", "a", "y", "e", "d", " ", "b", "e", "h", "i", "n", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "a", "l", "k", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "K", "a", "t", "r", "i", "n", "a", ",", " ", "h", "o", "p", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "s", "a", "y", " ", "y", "e", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "h", "i", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "N", "o", "b", "o", "d", "y", " ", "k", "n", "o", "w", "s", " ", "w", "h", "a", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "o", "o", "n